{"schema": "text+options-v4", "places": {"7c3364bed91fd7e8": {"text": "Your legs ache as you fumble in your pocket for your key. The hot sun scorches your back as you unlock the door. Enter your name: OK Cancel", "visits": 103, "energy": -2, "finds": [], "clues": 0, "open": true, "text_key": "6aeeac84e5ff30d5", "options": ["door", "OK", "Cancel"]}, "4286d21e18447f45": {"text": "Your legs ache as you fumble in your pocket for your key. The hot sun scorches your back as you unlock the door.", "visits": 103, "energy": -2, "finds": [], "clues": 0, "open": false, "text_key": "d3226b251e95569a", "options": ["door"]}, "b29e5ba83f20314a": {"text": "↶ You are still panting as you enter your house. You really want to rest your legs by lying on the couch, but you also need to do your homework. Your dog Spot i", "visits": 103, "energy": -3, "finds": [], "clues": 1, "open": false, "text_key": "4300e74e10925ef5", "options": ["couch", "homework", "kitchen"]}, "402c03dace5ac7bb": {"text": "↶ You put your feet up and your legs feel better. Start scrolling on your phone Get up", "visits": 12, "energy": 2, "finds": [], "clues": 0, "open": false, "text_key": "6b1e4b3b0419afeb", "options": ["Start scrolling on your phone", "Get up"]}, "710ad9383a11b214": {"text": "↶ You are on the first floor. You could go to the couch, but you also need to do your homework. Go to the kitchen. You are tired.", "visits": 3, "energy": -2, "finds": [], "clues": 0, "open": false, "text_key": "70bafba623162bfb", "options": ["couch", "homework", "kitchen"]}, "59ba699aa5815740": {"text": "↶ You scroll until you start to get hungry, so you go to make some food in the kitchen.", "visits": 1, "energy": 0, "finds": [], "clues": 0, "open": false, "text_key": "f8d73cf0a14b08e5", "options": ["kitchen"]}, "7afcce35bb9746f3": {"text": "↶ Spot looks up at you as he sits in the kitchen. \"How's my good boy?\" you say as you go to pet him. Spot runs around you, wagging his tail. He slips through yo", "visits": 96, "energy": 0, "finds": [], "clues": 2, "open": false, "text_key": "56a77593f8308920", "options": ["door"]}, "ac728c9b165dbbf2": {"text": "↶ Spot ran out the door! You are well rested and Have enough energy to Go After Spot! You yell after him, \"Spot!\" You wonder why Spot was in the kitchen You go ", "visits": 98, "energy": 3, "finds": [], "clues": 1, "open": false, "text_key": "9488547ed92169b5", "options": ["You yell after him, \"Spot!\"", "You go back inside"]}, "a2f609e7b4164ea6": {"text": "↶ You sprint out the door to try and catch Spot, but he is nowhere in sight. You must find Spot quickly! You are not supposed to be out of the house! Mom makes ", "visits": 3, "energy": 0, "finds": [], "clues": 1, "open": false, "text_key": "e16546405e0daad0", "options": ["school", "restaurant"]}, "279cc5b673200c86": {"text": "↶ You are at school. Your school is very small, with only a few classrooms, one for each subject. Look around the playground. Go to the store. Go to your house.", "visits": 73, "energy": 0, "finds": [], "clues": 0, "open": false, "text_key": "29998c1ea791d4d6", "options": ["playground", "store", "house"]}, "ae27d018ca8434f1": {"text": "↶ The playground is empty, but maybe Spot is hiding here. Play on the swings. It's fun! Check out the tube slide.", "visits": 203, "energy": 0, "finds": [], "clues": 1, "open": false, "text_key": "70b74a55f63a903b", "options": ["swings", "slide", "back"]}, "b37c6c372caa3b47": {"text": "↶ You play on the swings, but it's not fun. You really should be searching for Spot right now. To playground", "visits": 68, "energy": 0, "finds": [], "clues": 1, "open": false, "text_key": "cf292639bdb8767c", "options": ["To playground"]}, "cdc3af002b376428": {"text": "↶ What better way to look for Spot in the slide then by sliding down yourself! You have a moment of fun, but then realize what's at stake. Spot wasn't in the sl", "visits": 66, "energy": 0, "finds": [], "clues": 1, "open": false, "text_key": "2896d3850962c10e", "options": ["To playground"]}, "9f94f65b2af59b03": {"text": "↶ You go into the store. You don't go here often; usually, your Mom does the shopping. Check the aisles. Keep searching past the store. Run to the school.", "visits": 6, "energy": 0, "finds": [], "clues": 0, "open": false, "text_key": "30a8f99c0a29fdbb", "options": ["aisles", "past the store", "school"]}, "81dbf0e1d00b2cb6": {"text": "↶ You at in front of your house. You could go left towards the school, or right towards the restaurant, or back into your house.", "visits": 5, "energy": 0, "finds": [], "clues": 0, "open": false, "text_key": "93453e1cf6176973", "options": ["school", "restaurant", "house"]}, "cff78fc6045e9c62": {"text": "↶ Spot ran out the door! You are very tired. You wonder why Spot was in the kitchen You go back inside", "visits": 189, "energy": -3, "finds": [], "clues": 1, "open": false, "text_key": "d85b1b37302faabe", "options": ["You go back inside"]}, "45f86c09785e7719": {"text": "↶ \"Why was Spot in the kitchen?\", you wonder to yourself. He's supposed to be in the living room on his dog bed! He always is! ...", "visits": 94, "energy": 0, "finds": [], "clues": 1, "open": false, "text_key": "957b28a9aa575363", "options": ["..."]}, "d062b567e8ce7f94": {"text": "↶ You are on the first floor. You could go to the couch, but you also need to do your homework. Go to the kitchen. Go out the front door. You are very tired.", "visits": 96, "energy": -3, "finds": [], "clues": 0, "open": false, "text_key": "5fe89439fbb43cb1", "options": ["couch", "homework", "kitchen", "door"]}, "751afd7cb8fe6867": {"text": "↶ You are on the first floor. You could go to the couch, but you also need to do your homework. Go to the kitchen. Go out the front door. You are well rested.", "visits": 203, "energy": 3, "finds": [], "clues": 0, "open": false, "text_key": "16a05f0d069be489", "options": ["couch", "homework", "kitchen", "door"]}, "6b5e32da7a1019c4": {"text": "↶ The kitchen is empty. back", "visits": 3, "energy": 0, "finds": [], "clues": 0, "open": false, "text_key": "f3ab0aed42b79908", "options": ["back"]}, "6353a0508036f664": {"text": "↶ Spot ran out the door! You are well rested and Have enough energy to Go After Spot! You yell after him, \"Spot!\" You go back inside", "visits": 2, "energy": 3, "finds": [], "clues": 1, "open": false, "text_key": "33497a009c31b699", "options": ["Go After Spot", "You yell after him, \"Spot!\"", "You go back inside"]}, "2ea8f3dd4b61074d": {"text": "↶ \"Spot!\", you yell out the door. \"Is something wrong honey?\" your Mom asks from the kitchen. \"No! Everythings fine, Mom! \"Ok, just remember, you have a very st", "visits": 88, "energy": 0, "finds": [], "clues": 1, "open": false, "text_key": "683dcd0039c1bf8f", "options": [". . ."]}, "6be65997c28063be": {"text": "↶ You have no choice but to go after Spot! Mom would freak out if Spot got lost!", "visits": 88, "energy": 0, "finds": [], "clues": 1, "open": false, "text_key": "9e191065f04f7110", "options": ["go after Spot"]}, "9d3fa7827ae0c967": {"text": "↶ You sprint out the door to try and catch Spot, but he is nowhere in sight. You could go left towards the school, or right towards the restaurant.", "visits": 88, "energy": 0, "finds": [], "clues": 1, "open": false, "text_key": "374d10ef637c1835", "options": ["school", "restaurant"]}, "db0db8b3b766069d": {"text": "↶ You are at the restaurant. You go here with your Mom once a week on Saturdays. They offer so many dishes it feels like they have anything you could ask for! T", "visits": 175, "energy": 0, "finds": [], "clues": 0, "open": false, "text_key": "1a248a9db3ea7571", "options": ["waiters", "park", "home"]}, "15ab4cd4efed251d": {"text": "↶ You go to the park. You take Spot here often to play in the grass. Check the bushes. Keep going, to the Hospital. Go back to the restaurant.", "visits": 1071, "energy": 0, "finds": [], "clues": 1, "open": false, "text_key": "6f24b36420f5d92c", "options": ["bushes", "Hospital", "restaurant", "back to park"]}, "05c306d8d450362b": {"text": "↶ You walk up to the bushes carefully. You run up to the bushes.", "visits": 89, "energy": 0, "finds": [], "clues": 0, "open": false, "text_key": "d07c1a5fa2bd608f", "options": ["You walk up to the bushes carefully", "You run up to the bushes"]}, "3551858baa2e435f": {"text": "↶ You look behind the bushes. It's like a maze in here! Turn left Turn right", "visits": 89, "energy": 0, "finds": [], "clues": 0, "open": false, "text_key": "20067f49f0d448c5", "options": ["Turn left", "Turn right"]}, "52457e322b4200f4": {"text": "↶ You reach a dead end. You heard a noise to your left and realize it's just a bird. back to park", "visits": 88, "energy": 0, "finds": [], "clues": 0, "open": false, "text_key": "9908652c1b4095f7", "options": ["back to park"]}, "7d321e74003a65ab": {"text": "↶ You are at the hospital. Something about hospitals frighten you. Talk to the receptionist. Keep going, past the hospital. Go back to the park.", "visits": 6, "energy": 0, "finds": [], "clues": 0, "open": false, "text_key": "c25f642cf049f289", "options": ["receptionist", "past the hospital", "park"]}, "203187540e755d92": {"text": "↶ Hi! Have you seen a dog here recently? I just lost him. He has white fur with a black spot around his left eye. The waiter is a woman that looks to be in her ", "visits": 161, "energy": 0, "finds": [], "clues": 3, "open": false, "text_key": "22ac8a99684a4cdb", "options": ["He responds..."]}, "2fcde69a8d1db807": {"text": "↶ \"Hi ! I'm sorry you lost Spot. I havn't seen him. I hope you find him though!\" How do you know my name? How do you know my dog's name?", "visits": 77, "energy": 0, "finds": [], "clues": 1, "open": false, "text_key": "826f2371e2d5a071", "options": ["How do you know my name?", "How do you know my dog's name?"]}, "85792fade07aa5fc": {"text": "↶ \"How do you know my dog's name?\" you ask. \"I heard from a friend that there was a dog missing named spot! I hope you find him! I got to go now!\" back", "visits": 75, "energy": 0, "finds": [], "clues": 1, "open": false, "text_key": "a22d8ac549c210cd", "options": ["back"]}, "0f50b0b3a379cf6b": {"text": "↶ \"How do you know my name?\" you ask the woman. \"You mother told me! We talked once. Now if you'll excuse me, I have to attend a table.\" back", "visits": 1, "energy": 0, "finds": [], "clues": 0, "open": false, "text_key": "817ecadf4f59da68", "options": ["back"]}, "183a3b20ea013ff7": {"text": "↶ You went to your room to do homework. You always did your homework on time and liked doing it. Everyone in your class supported you. \"Hey! Have you seen Spot!", "visits": 2, "energy": 0, "finds": [], "clues": 1, "open": false, "text_key": "65d77af04f095341", "options": ["door"]}, "34f32c3c2d3cf7f0": {"text": "↶ You see the open front door and look to the kitchen where Spot was sitting. Nothing. Gone. Spot must have gotten outside.", "visits": 2, "energy": 0, "finds": [], "clues": 1, "open": false, "text_key": "24a61e2a272a7da8", "options": ["outside"]}, "2d5f6b639d16b410": {"text": "↶ You went to your room to do homework. You always did your homework on time and liked doing it. Everyone in your class supported you. back", "visits": 293, "energy": 0, "finds": [], "clues": 0, "open": false, "text_key": "64bc807336f0ae24", "options": ["back"]}, "246a0cfffd4f150d": {"text": "↶ You are on the first floor. You could go to the couch, but you also need to do your homework. Go to the kitchen. Go out the front door. You are tired.", "visits": 97, "energy": -2, "finds": [], "clues": 0, "open": false, "text_key": "6e3313c3861b5efb", "options": ["couch", "homework", "kitchen", "door"]}, "ee951460f34b8708": {"text": "↶ \"I'm sorry to hear that. I have a dog myself and would be worried sick if he was missing. I haven't seen a dog here, but I will let you know if I do!\" Say \"Ok", "visits": 3, "energy": 0, "finds": [], "clues": 0, "open": false, "text_key": "4405441bc9b14e45", "options": ["Say \"Okay!\" and go on your way.", "\"Are you sure?\""]}, "967651e236c8c95a": {"text": "↶ Nothing has changed. Leave quietly!", "visits": 1, "energy": 0, "finds": [], "clues": 0, "open": false, "text_key": "082709f83a97a8ab", "options": ["Leave quietly!"]}, "6fc5e44e6734ecb4": {"text": "↶ You scan a few aisles in the store, not seeing much yet. Search the fresh produce aisle. Explore the bread aisle.", "visits": 4, "energy": 0, "finds": [], "clues": 0, "open": false, "text_key": "677acc3a90de2925", "options": ["fresh produce aisle", "bread aisle", "back"]}, "caee37d7cf06fcb1": {"text": "↶ You speed-walk to the cucumbers because you know Spot loves them. As you walk, you notice that the bananas are all perfectly ripe. Not only that, but all the ", "visits": 1, "energy": 0, "finds": [], "clues": 1, "open": false, "text_key": "d0e0b08c5dd6101f", "options": ["Go back"]}, "32753c20598640aa": {"text": "↶ A large block of concrete stands before you. You havn't been this far from home before. You aren't supposed to be here. At least that's what you heard from yo", "visits": 4, "energy": 0, "finds": [], "clues": 0, "open": false, "text_key": "ba038fbe2138e9a8", "options": ["Stay longer and look around", "store", "Hospital"]}, "09fb3b13c2163fa3": {"text": "↶ You take a quick look around. You can't help but wonder what this thing is. It is very peculiar. It's in the shape of a perfect cube. Maybe you'll understand ", "visits": 2, "energy": 0, "finds": [], "clues": 0, "open": false, "text_key": "31920dfd006443b5", "options": ["store", "Hospital"]}, "51d2accb5736adda": {"text": "↶ There are all kinds of bread here, some that you've never heard of before. You don't see spot right away, but you are persistant and look behind the loaves. A", "visits": 1, "energy": 0, "finds": ["you pick up"], "clues": 1, "open": false, "text_key": "2b2386f1196523c2", "options": ["Go back"]}, "59687c0146c4b9c4": {"text": "↶ Hi, I lost my dog. Do you think he could be in here? The receptionist responds...", "visits": 2, "energy": 0, "finds": [], "clues": 0, "open": false, "text_key": "226c24eac3a95314", "options": ["The receptionist responds..."]}, "5b9e3971bc710576": {"text": "↶ \"I doubt it, but you can look inside if you want. You'll have to wait 15 min.\" You hear the yelling again. Wait 15 min and go inside. \"What was that yelling?\"", "visits": 2, "energy": 0, "finds": [], "clues": 0, "open": false, "text_key": "54aa4253d5405f06", "options": ["Wait 15 min and go inside.", "\"What was that yelling?\"."]}, "917fb32b25e96751": {"text": "↶ You follow the yelling sounds to a room at the back of the hospital. You peer through the blinds to get a better look. \"I'm not crazy!\" the patient says to th", "visits": 1, "energy": 0, "finds": [], "clues": 0, "open": false, "text_key": "c334dbd6695b2810", "options": ["leave"]}, "7882cc2ae16aa54b": {"text": "↶ You go deeper into the bushes. You can go left or right. Turn left Turn right", "visits": 88, "energy": 0, "finds": [], "clues": 0, "open": false, "text_key": "f5bd96b364234a0b", "options": ["Turn left", "Turn right"]}, "0023c0b16000a172": {"text": "↶ You hear more noises. Go around the corner", "visits": 87, "energy": 0, "finds": [], "clues": 0, "open": false, "text_key": "7918a777ea01a368", "options": ["Go around the corner"]}, "400ab5e941ebf86b": {"text": "↶ You reach a fork in the path. You are getting worried; maybe you should go back. Something feels off. Turn left Turn right back to park", "visits": 1, "energy": 0, "finds": [], "clues": 0, "open": true, "text_key": "4dde4e700cb140c0", "options": ["Turn left", "Turn right", "back to park"]}, "6f6066d252c658bb": {"text": "↶ You already checked here. back to park", "visits": 586, "energy": 0, "finds": [], "clues": 0, "open": false, "text_key": "0a37b36d652c8667", "options": ["back to park"]}, "8f28e72c3189538b": {"text": "↶ His smile faded and looked at you confused. \"Yes I'm sure. I said I'd let you know if I saw him.\" \"Okay, sorry.\" \"I don't believe you!", "visits": 2, "energy": 0, "finds": [], "clues": 0, "open": false, "text_key